# LEARNER C ON THE CLUSTER, TOWN05 + TOWN01, ACTION REPEAT 2, c0's EXPERT ROWS PINNED IN THE REPLAY
# (user 2026-11-11: "i want confirmation of learner implementation and hyperparameters so we can start town05
# and town01 train"; "minor simulator and client details are fine").
# = slurm/local_frl_c0emb_t01_ar2_xp.env, the local run frl_c0emb_t01_ar2_xp_local (best learner-C run), with
# ONLY these changes:
#   - ENV_TOWNS=Town05,Town01: one env and one CARLA server per town; learner C drives one at a time and moves
#     to the next town at every episode end (one transition and one update per step, as with one town);
#   - the cluster's copies of the same files: c0 trunk (same md5 2735e6ae...), expert replay (md5 5f54c2d8...),
#     Town01 steering-probe cache (md5 e2614ca3...);
#   - the run budget the local launcher exported: 250k decisions, 250k-row replay on the CPU.
# Every learner setting and the reward are the local run's: check with scripts/dump_frl_config.sh (diff).
. "$REPO/slurm/local_frl_c0emb_t01_ar2_xp.env"
export ENV_TOWNS=Town05,Town01
export FRL_C0=$HOME/carla-rl/checkpoints/il_bc_c0/step_15000
export FRL_EXPERT=$HOME/carla-rl/checkpoints/expert_replay/c0_m1_t01t05_k2.npz
export FRL_PROBE_CACHE=$HOME/carla-rl/checkpoints/encoder_probe_2026-11-09/features_Town01.npz
export FRL_MAX_STEPS=250000 FRL_REPLAY=250000 FRL_REPLAY_DEVICE=cpu
